---
const stats = [
  { num: 4, suffix: '+', label: 'Years in data & IT' },
  { num: 40, suffix: '%+', label: 'Manual work automated' },
  { num: 50, suffix: '+', label: 'Servers monitored' },
  { num: 2, suffix: '', label: 'App stores shipped to' },
];
---

<section id="about" class="section-soft">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="about-head" data-reveal="left">
      <span class="section-label">About</span>
      <h2>End-to-end data work, with a <span class="italic shine">soft spot</span> for shipping.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-body" data-reveal="right" style="--reveal-delay:0.1s">
      <p>
        I'm a Data Engineer at Amentum with four years of experience across IT,
        automation, and data work. Most of my projects involve SQL, dashboards,
        internal tools, and finding better ways to handle messy operational processes.
      </p>
      <p>
        I enjoy the side of data engineering that connects everything together.
        Pulling data from APIs, cleaning it in Python, modeling it in SQL Server
        or Postgres, and turning it into dashboards people can actually use day to day.
      </p>
      <p>
        A lot of my work also drifts into full-stack development. I like building
        internal tools that make life easier for the teams using them, not just the
        engineers maintaining them.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of work, I built and launched my own mobile app on the App Store
        and Google Play, handling the frontend, backend, database, analytics, and
        deployment myself. Those projects are my favorite because I love being involved
        in the whole process from idea to launch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container stats" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:0.15s">
    {stats.map((s, i) => (
      <div class="stat" style={`--reveal-delay:${0.1 + i * 0.08}s`} data-reveal>
        <span class="stat-num"><span data-count={s.num} data-suffix={s.suffix}>0</span></span>
        <span class="stat-label">{s.label}</span>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.35fr;
    gap: 4.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-head h2 {
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .about-body p + p {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
  }

  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 4.5rem;
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .stat {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stat-num {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .stat-label {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .stats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
